ss&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8r3k7f5HPh4Q7kNvwHOvAsy&_nc_oc=AdpnO1_fk4VhluD_F085xh4QZFTS30SjSYntomPBHEeRrIQsq31XD0UalFJzWfnAzqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV_icwWQVaTx8o1TqcbAKUtNaznVVs-CnM_S7VsVgM-CQ&oe=6B0EEBF6"}, {"file_name": "capture final.png", "id": "913405551109535", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_913405554442868_4620760491231566657_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M8_wJDLsmQcQ7kNvwFE_YpW&_nc_oc=AdrKFyZ91r3jI2TDTg43k7aDiELutRX5VxiQ0SOU--nEh01su_QJ7SEgbO-NrMsvpvg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWZZT328qMlOWguvFDKl3j8lgDNQpHI8m258w6Qi0XsYA&oe=6B0EEB2C"}, {"file_name": "capture 1.png", "id": "783698660711990", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_783698664045323_5210865340295355557_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0T0FTWqK2CMQ7kNvwHbLRTV&_nc_oc=Adq4pTbWyMZzv9ft33TmKUDq_HRViVVhpSf2L_DHtDbXX44o-lXkxTH3GIXkGkKgE8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUZHeykbA3H93ihstd8Hd_DgK0dpaC5uoVpH7f3xEsrxQ&oe=6B0EEDF3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CM StoRE - couverture paysage.png", "id": "1415640733376481", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822863_1415640736709814_2754899795012134397_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pmeyb-7w41UQ7kNvwH5W065&_nc_oc=AdrFbZ5nHkETHmva3_w6PGSqp1jBtW9PDUDR5yDx89-TMiHwiKJ-gibF1H-MNuEaF58&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWc_2W86JPD7wIFLooaibw0aAZshHkWEIYTuGmWtOIfyw&oe=6B0EEC3C"}, "display_name": "Cr\u00eape Master! Alpha", "keywords": ["combat", "magic", "crepe", "spell", "action"], "long_description": "# Cr\u00eape Master! Alpha is a fun solo adventure in magical girl style! Become a Cr\u00eape Goddess and protect earth against an alien army!\n\n# Features: \n\n1. BONK WITH YOUR MAGICAL PAN: Mix heavy and light hits,break guards, and take back the stolen ingredients! \n{1401849871406732}\n\n2. CRAFT SPELLS WITH INGREDIENTS: To cast spells you have to craft them prior. Enter a Crepo-Trance, grab the right ingredients, and mix up cr\u00eapes at a lightning speed. Unleash them later in battle with a pose!\n{793123986817059}\n\n3. MAGICAL GIRL POSE: Pose like a true Magical Girl to summon your freshly cooked cr\u00eapes and cast powerful spells. Just move your arms and fire them off!\n{894263426315476}\n\n# YOUR STORY: YOU ARE A CR\u00caPE GODDESS HANA\u2026.\n\nIn the far reaches of space, a tyrant has sworn to destroy the Cr\u00eape, the universal symbol of joy and community. \n\nOn Earth, an ordinary student finds a ruby-studded pan and, by cooking the best cr\u00eape in the universe, awakens the powers of the Cr\u00eape Goddess!\n\nShe then learns a shocking secret: our planet is actually a cr\u00eape\u2026 and therefore flat. If the Cr\u00eape is destroyed, the world will fall with it....\n\n-> If you like the concept and want to support development (or just share cr\u00eape memes), join our Discord community and give us your feedback! \nhttps://discord.com/invite/8qcQHspEAr\n\n\n", "short_description": "Cr\u00eape Master! is a fast and crazy combat game where you fight like a magical girl. Become the Cr\u00eape Goddess, smash aliens with your magical pan and cast cr\u00eape-powered spells by striking real magical girl poses with your arms.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://hallucinations-studio.com/cm_privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hallucinations Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hallucinations-studio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "